 ("p", "A reed stands vertically with its tip **2 units** above the water. Bent over, the tip touches the water **6 units** away. Let the depth be x; the reed's length is x + 2 and we get a right triangle with sides 6, x, x + 2. Then 6² + x² = (x + 2)², so 36 = 4x + 4 and **x = 8**. The depth is 8 units."),
 ("table", ["Application", "Method", "Result"], [["Diagonal of a square of side 9 cm", "d² = 2 × 81", "d = 9√2 cm (≈ 12.7 cm)"], ["Side of a rhombus with diagonals 10 and 24", "The diagonals bisect each other at right angles: (5)² + (12)² = side²", "side = 13"], ["Height of an equilateral triangle of side 8", "The altitude bisects the base: h² = 64 − 16 = 48", "h = 4√3, area = ½ × 8 × 4√3 = 16√3"], ["Right triangle with hypotenuse 25, one side 7", "b² = 625 − 49", "b = 24"]]),
